var DIC=[[["Put these words in ABC order the way a dictionary does: tiger, apple, mouse.","apple, mouse, tiger"],["The guide words at the top of a dictionary page are cat and dog. Would the word cow be on this page? Tell why.","Yes. cow comes after cat and before dog in ABC order."],["You want to check the spelling of the word friend. What tool can you use? Tell what you would do.","A dictionary. Look for the f words, use the guide words to find the page, then check the letters in order."]],
[["Put these words in ABC order the way a dictionary does: pig, cow, hen.","cow, hen, pig"],["The guide words are fish and goat. Would the word frog be on this page? Tell why.","Yes. frog comes after fish and before goat."],["You are not sure if the word is spelled cage or caje. How can a dictionary help?","Look up the word in the dictionary (under c) and see which spelling is listed."]],
[["Put these words in ABC order: zebra, lion, bear.","bear, lion, zebra"],["The guide words are map and net. Would the word moon be on this page? Tell why.","Yes. moon comes after map and before net."],["How can you use a dictionary to fix a spelling you are not sure about?","Find the word in ABC order, use the guide words, and compare the letters with what you wrote."]],
[["Put these words in ABC order: sun, rain, wind.","rain, sun, wind"],["The guide words are ball and bug. Would the word bike be on this page? Tell why.","Yes. bike comes after ball and before bug."],["You wrote wuz but you think the word is was. What can you use to check?","A dictionary. Look under w and find the spelling of was."]],
[["Put these words in ABC order: jump, hop, skip.","hop, jump, skip"],["The guide words are rain and sand. Would the word rock be on this page? Tell why.","Yes. rock comes after rain and before sand."],["You are not sure how to spell the word badge. What can you do?","Look it up in a beginning dictionary, using ABC order and the guide words, and copy the correct spelling."]]];
