var RG=[[["Solve 53 + 29 with a drawing or a written method. Then tell why you had to make a new ten.","82. The ones made 12 (3 + 9), which is more than 9, so 10 ones were regrouped as 1 ten."],["Solve 71 - 38. Tell why you had to take a ten apart.","33. There were not enough ones (1 is less than 8), so 1 ten was broken into 10 ones."]],
[["Solve 47 + 36. Tell why you had to make a new ten.","83. 7 + 6 = 13 ones, so 10 ones became 1 ten."],["Solve 62 - 27. Tell why you had to take a ten apart.","35. 2 ones is not enough to take away 7, so 1 ten was regrouped into 10 ones."]],
[["Solve 258 + 167. Tell why you had to regroup.","425. 8 + 7 = 15 ones, so 10 ones became 1 ten. 5 + 6 + 1 = 12 tens, so 10 tens became 1 hundred."],["Solve 413 - 156. Tell why you had to regroup.","257. Not enough ones or tens at first, so a ten was broken into 10 ones and a hundred into 10 tens."]],
[["Solve 385 + 249. Tell why you had to regroup.","634. 5 + 9 = 14 ones, regroup 10 ones to 1 ten, and 8 + 4 + 1 = 13 tens, regroup 10 tens to 1 hundred."],["Solve 602 - 247. Tell why you had to regroup.","355. 0 tens and 2 ones, so you regroup a hundred into tens, and then a ten into ones."]],
[["Solve 436 + 189. Tell why you had to regroup.","625. 6 + 9 = 15 ones, so a new ten. 3 + 8 + 1 = 12 tens, so a new hundred."],["Solve 540 - 285. Tell why you had to regroup.","255. 0 ones is not enough to take 5, so a ten becomes 10 ones, and 3 tens is not enough for 8 so a hundred is regrouped."]]];
